The original combined proof and the isolated loop claim have both closed with `#Top`. One reviewer-added Unicode concrete assertion exposed a K tool/parser limitation for astral code points; the exact failure is preserved, and I’m separating that from an ASCII concrete boundary run so it cannot be mistaken for a proof verdict. The isolated entry proof is still running.
